              <span className="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-7 h-7 rounded-full text-xs text-white" style={{ backgroundColor: '#ff8269' }}>36–38</span>
              Interactive Network Calendar
            </h3>
            <div className="rounded-2xl border border-[#ead0c7] overflow-hidden">
              <div className="px-4 py-2 text-xs flex justify-between items-center" style={{ backgroundColor: '#382a27', color: '#fdf7f5' }}>
                <span>Week View</span>
                <span className="opacity-70">My Events · Network Events</span>
              </div>
              <div className="p-3 bg-[#fdf7f5] text-xs md:text-sm space-y-2">
                <div className="flex justify-between items-center mb-1">
                  <span>Mon</span>
                  <span>Tue</span>
                  <span>Wed</span>
                  <span>Thu</span>
                  <span>Fri</span>
                </div>
                <div className="h-28 grid grid-cols-5 gap-2">
                  <div className="rounded-lg bg-white border border-[#ead0c7]"></div>
                  <div className="rounded-lg bg-white border border-[#ead0c7] flex items-center justify-center text-[11px]" style={{ backgroundColor: '#ffede7' }}>
                    1–1 Mentorship
                  </div>
                  <div className="rounded-lg bg-white border border-[#ead0c7]"></div>
                  <div className="rounded-lg bg-white border border-[#ead0c7] flex items-center justify-center text-[11px]" style={{ backgroundColor: '#ff8269', color: '#fdf7f5' }}>
                    AI‑scheduled call
                  </div>
                  <div className="rounded-lg bg-white border border-[#ead0c7]"></div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p className="text-sm md:text-base">
              All AI‑scheduled calls, group sessions, and events appear here (Story 36). Users can also create their own events and control visibility and Give Forward requirements (Story 37).
            </p>
          </div>

          {/* Event creation & joining public events (37–39) */}
          <div className="space-y-4">
            <div className="rounded-2xl bg-white border border-[#f0d2ca] shadow-sm p-4 space-y-3 text-sm md:text-base">
              <h3 className="font-semibold flex items-center gap-2">
                <span className="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-7 h-7 rounded-full text-xs text-white" style={{ backgroundColor: '#ff8269' }}>37</span>
                Create 1–1 or Group Events
              </h3>
              <ul className="list-disc list-inside space-y-1">
                <li>Set title, time, location / video link, capacity (Story 37)</li>
                <li>Decide if event is public, invite‑only, or requires points</li>
              </ul>
              <div className="mt-2 rounded-xl border border-dashed border-[#ff8269] px-3 py-2 text-xs md:text-sm bg-[#fff8f6]">
                + Create event &ldquo;Tech Mentorship Hour&rdquo; · Public · 20 seats · 50 pts required
              </div>
            </div>

            <div className="rounded-2xl bg-white border border-[#f0d2ca] shadow-sm p-4 space-y-3 text-sm md:text-base">
              <h3 className="font-semibold flex items-center gap-2">
                <span className="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-7 h-7 rounded-full text-xs text-white" style={{ backgroundColor: '#ff8269' }}>38–39</span>
                Availability & Joining Network Events
              </h3>
              <ul className="list-disc list-inside space-y-1">
                <li>View others’ shared availability windows from their profile (Story 38)</li>
                <li>Join public/network‑wide events directly from the calendar (Story 39)</li>
              </ul>
              <div className="mt-2 rounded-xl border border-[#ead0c7] px-3 py-2 text-xs md:text-sm bg-[#fdf7f5] flex flex-col gap-1">
                <span><strong>Network Event:</strong> &ldquo;Global Armenian Founders Meetup&rdquo;</span>
                <span>Host: GAIN · Online · Sat 19:00</span>
                <button
                  className="mt-1 self-start px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold"
                  style={{ backgroundColor: '#bf0d34', color: '#fdf7f5' }}
                >
                  Join event
                </button>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <footer className="text-center text-xs md:text-sm text-[#7c635c] pb-4 opacity-80">
        GAIN MVP · Brand colors: #ff8269 · #bf0d34 · #382a27 · Designed for PPT landscape screenshots.
      </footer>
    </div>
  );
